Package: bwTools
Type: Package
Title: Native R Tools for BigWig, WIG, and bedGraph Files
Version: 0.8.10
Authors@R: person("Rensc", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "rensc0718@163.com")
Description: Provides native R tools for reading and writing local BigWig,
    WIG, and bedGraph signal tracks, indexed genomic retrieval, exact and
    zoom-aware interval statistics, multi-track merging, signal aggregation,
    format conversion, and performance diagnostics. BigWig binary I/O uses
    base R random-access operations, binary encoding, and zlib compression
    without bundled C or C++ code or external UCSC executables. Public
    in-memory signal coordinates are 1-based closed and are represented through
    the standardized BwgTrack schema v2.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/Renscq/bwTools, https://renscq.github.io/bwTools/
BugReports: https://github.com/Renscq/bwTools/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: data.table
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
